# Torvus Bog 0g_swamp_hall layer 3: CPlantScarabSwarm e0c1e00b6 (the uids in `obj` vary per boot).
# psc3 run 1 (read-only probe): god-mode player stands beside the swarm so the boids take attack
# slots, then shifts position twice (attack angle / proximity) and reports.  1200 frames, fast.
